MCP server "agent-director" exists in multiple scopes:
  - Local config (private to you in this project) (@HOME@/.claude.json [project: @HOME@/w/a])
  - User config (available in all your projects) (@HOME@/.claude.json)

To remove from a specific scope, use:
  claude mcp remove agent-director -s local
  claude mcp remove agent-director -s user
